@layout()
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-sm dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy describes how SpeakerWindows collects, uses, and protects your information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect information you provide directly, including your account details (name, email) and the content you import into the service.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We use your information to provide and improve the service, authenticate your account, and enable search functionality across your illustrations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">3. Data Storage</h2>
      <p>
        Your data is stored securely on our servers. We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">4. Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties, except as required by law or to operate the service.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">5. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use session cookies to maintain your authentication state. These cookies are essential for the service to function.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can access, update, or delete your account and data at any time through the settings page or by contacting support.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">7. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes through the service.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
@end
